## Overview

This document summarizes key terms of MedSync's standard Master Services Agreement (MSA). The full MSA is available for customer review upon request.

---

## Agreement Structure

### Document Hierarchy

| Document | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| Master Services Agreement | Core terms and conditions |
| Order Form | Specific products, pricing, term |
| Service Level Agreement | Performance commitments |
| Business Associate Agreement | HIPAA compliance |
| Data Processing Addendum | Privacy/GDPR compliance |
| Acceptable Use Policy | Usage restrictions |

### Precedence

In case of conflict: Order Form > DPA/BAA > MSA > SLA > AUP

