## Termination

### Termination Rights

| Party | Grounds | Notice |
|-------|---------|--------|
| Either | Material breach (uncured 30 days) | Written |
| Either | Insolvency/bankruptcy | Immediate |
| Customer | Convenience (annual) | 60 days before renewal |
| MedSync | Non-payment (30 days overdue) | 10 days notice |
| MedSync | AUP violation | Immediate (egregious) |

### Post-Termination

| Obligation | Timeline |
|------------|----------|
| Customer data export | 30 days |
| Data deletion | 90 days (or per retention) |
| Invoice settlement | Net 30 |
| Survival | Confidentiality, liability, IP |

